This distribution contains an altered Proxima external nonce seeker and a CUDA
backend. Rust crates retain their declared Apache-2.0 license. Proxima-origin
material retains the MIT notice in LICENSES/Proxima-MIT.txt.

Proxima: https://github.com/lunfardo314/proxima
Source lineage: commit 60515d0074e63e467de6d63532c1236c1bec332a,
with local CUDA, telemetry and persistent-job changes. Local changes are not
represented as changes authored or endorsed by the Proxima project.

Modified Rust files carry local-change notices. client.rs adapts persistent-job
identity/verdict handling; seeker/Cargo.toml adds standalone paths and CUDA
dependencies. The final attribution update adds comments only, without changing
the implementation or any original third-party license terms.

CUDA field/group arithmetic derives from ref10 through solana-labs/solana-perf-libs
commit 233c4457fd8d425da99cb3db46b2be8eb8b98997, as attributed in kernel.cu.
Its altered-source notice and original license remain in the source and
LICENSES/ref10.txt. SHA-512 derives from public-domain TweetNaCl (20140427).

curve25519-dalek remains a Cargo registry dependency; its BSD notice is retained
in LICENSES/curve25519-dalek.txt. Cargo.lock records dependency versions/checksums.
No NVIDIA toolkit, driver DLL or runtime library is redistributed.
